# eoschool method v1

Full contract: [`.cursor/skills/eoschool/METHOD_V1.md`](../skills/eoschool/METHOD_V1.md) (mirror under `frontend/public/skills/eoschool/`).

## Hierarchy

`cycle (1–3) → week (1–24) → day (1–5) → level (1–15) → subject (12)`.

v1 authors **level 6 only** (≈ **10-year-old**). One `.eoschool` JSON per cell (lesson + quiz).

Subjects: `mat`, `esp`, `ing`, `his`, `lat`, `LT`, `geo`, `cie`, `art`, `pro`, `teb`, `exe`.  
`ing` shares the weekly theme with `esp` but is a separate document.

## Dual storage

Edit cell JSON under `frontend/public/homescool/media/weekN/`, then `node scripts/build-homescool-curriculum.mjs` → `curriculum.json` + optional Mongo upsert. Do not update only one store.

## Pedagogy

- Day 1: 3 points + summary. Days 2–4: deepen. Day 5: five overview blocks (`pro`: ≥1) + **expo prep** (two lined columns under the review on the **same** Letter sheet — not a separate expo page).
- **Quiz (all days):** fixed **12** items/day — **8 mcq** + **4 write** (cite exact class phrases + explain). Day 1: 8 mcq from day 1. Days 2–5: 2 review mcq + 6 mcq today. Prefer fitting under the class on the same Letter sheet; day 5 still reserves expo lines under the review.
- Slot types in published packs: **`mcq` + `write` only**. Schema still allows legacy puzzles for old drafts; do not add them to new level-6 cells.
- Packing: full-page activities (`crossword`, `wordsearch`, `draw_*`, `grid_mark`) alone on a Letter page; `mcq`/`write` fill pages as before.
- **Drawings:** a practice gets a blank draw workspace only when `practiceNeedsDraw` matches verbs like dibuja/traza/bosqueja/colorea/pinta (or EN draw/sketch/trace) in the Práctica text — not every practice, not quiz `draw_*` types.

## Kid clarity (mandatory on every new/edited cell)

Do **not** ship a class that skips these. Full detail: `METHOD_V1.md` + `docs/specs/009-homescool-narrative-language.md`.

1. **Two-column lesson stack** — FE lays out lesson boxes in **two CSS columns** on the Letter sheet (margin **0.75 cm**). Author short, scannable blocks (`##` + `**bold**`); keep Idea / Explora / Práctica / Error as separate blank-line paragraphs. Avoid bare «frente a» / «vs» unless you truly want a Contraste pair.
2. **Day 2:** set `lesson.weekRecap` (short week overview; FE band ~5 cm) before the deepen point. No `priorDayRecap`.
3. **Days 3–4:** set `lesson.weekRecap` (~5 cm) **and** `lesson.priorDayRecap` (~2.5 cm, previous day’s focus) before the deepen point.
4. **Screening:** in bodies use `##` subtitle lines and `**bold**` key terms so the child can scan.
5. **Memory phrase:** every day, for `esp` `ing` `lat` `his` `LT` `geo` `cie`, set `lesson.memoryPhrase` (same week sentence; bold the anchors).
6. **Reference video:** set `supportUrl` to one age-appropriate (~8yo) educational http(s) video for that subject×week (**required on every class**).
7. **Language load:** for `esp` `ing` `lat`, include a rich **Más ejemplos / More examples** block (many worked sentences), not a single token example.

## UI / print

- DHS: cycle tabs → week grid → day grid → subject grid → Print.
- Stage: always stacked US Letter **portrait** pages; margin **0.75 cm** (`--hc-page-margin`); backend PDF capture must match.
- Lesson body: **two columns**; quiz MCQ choices have **no** border and **no** vertical padding.
- Media v1: `frontend/public/homescool/media/`.

## API

Docs-first. POST body is the `.eoschool` object (`confirmOverwrite` required). Do not invent HTML-primary materials for new content.
